      "scope": "The Republic of Turkey has territory in Asia; Anatolia means Asian Turkey here. The proportion 0.97 is a rounded area share, not population or an exact measurement. Publication dates do not establish an effective start date. Total-area figures differ among sources and are not combined to infer greater precision.",
